{"id":"d_main_27_02","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch27","label":"Chapter 27 · Exploration"},"label":"Moving on Together","stage":"27-9 STAGE · Start","prev":"d_main_27_01_e","next":"d_main_27_03_s","speakers":{"shifty_c":"Shifty","hammering":"Hammering","anis":"Anis","shifty":"Shifty","rapi":"Rapi","neon":"Neon","liveryn":"Liveryn","elegg":"Elegg"},"icons":{"shifty_c":"si_c907_00_s","hammering":"si_c490_00_s","anis":"si_c012_00_s","shifty":"si_c907_00_s","rapi":"si_c010_00_s","neon":"si_c011_00_s","liveryn":"si_c480_00_s","elegg":"si_c500_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_27_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_1","text":"During the exploration mission,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"RuinIndoor","bgArt":"ruinindoor","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_aztec_a","movie":null,"shown":["rapi","anis","neon","liveryn","elegg","hammering","shifty_c"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_2","text":"Liveryn, Hammering, and Elegg will become temporary members of the Commando Squad.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_3","text":"The Commander will retain command as usual.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_4","text":"Your goal is to explore what we are referring to as the Crystal Region.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_5","text":"As you can tell from the name, it is a place covered with mysterious crystals.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_6","text":"The area is quite extensive, so there is a high chance it might take some time for us to fully explore it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_7","text":"However, spending too much time exploring at this stage is not ideal, so you'll be conducting a cursory investigation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_8","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_8","text":"What are we looking for while we're there?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_9","text":"Other than rough topographical formations, the map doesn't provide any specific information, so we're short on details at the moment.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_10","text":"However, considering the nature of the area, collecting the crystals would make the most sense.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_11","text":"Even so, they should not be harvested recklessly without prior consideration.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_c","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_12","text":"Only collect the crystals that you deem pose no risk.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_13","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_13","text":"And how do we assess the risk?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_14","text":"I'll handle that. Minerals and I get along swimmingly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_15","text":"One glance is all I'll need to tell you if it's dangerous or not.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_16","text":"You look like someone who could do that sort of thing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_17","text":"So, in summary:","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["shifty"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_18","text":"You are to explore as wide an area as possible, and if it is determined that there is no risk, you will collect some crystals and return to the base.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_19","text":"That's all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_20","text":"Sounds simple enough.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_21","text":"I honestly thought it'd be something way more out there.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_22","text":"Since this is an unknown area, even the Central Government is exercising caution.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_23","text":"The other reason for increased wariness is due to how each of you are very important and valuable personnel.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_24","text":"Gosh, what a compliment!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_25","text":"We should get going straight away.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_26","text":"Yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_27","text":"One more thing before you leave.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_28","text":"What is it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_29","text":"You must leave a minimum of two squad members at Reclamation Site 01.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_30","text":"What?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_31","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_32","text":"As a contingency plan, I presume?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_33","text":"That and other reasons, yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_34","text":"In theory, the optical camouflage is a dependable safety measure, but this is the first time we're using it out in the field.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_35","text":"You might encounter new variations of Raptures who can see through the optical camouflage.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_36","text":"It's also imperative that you are able to tend to any members who become cut off from the group during your search.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_37","text":"If this place is left unattended, you'll be caught with your pants down if anything unexpected were to crop up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_38","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_39","text":"Who should stay...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_40","text":"... Anis and I will stay.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_41","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_42","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_42","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_43","text":"Of course I'd prefer that all of us go together, but this is the situation we're in.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_44","text":"Besides, these three have been dispatched here due to their proficiency in exploration.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_27_02_45","text":"We, on the other hand, have no such skills in that particular area.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_27_02_